    <string name="intro_zeus_1">Hold to charge.</string>
    <string name="intro_zeus_1_body">The power meter climbs for as long as you hold the bolt.</string>
    <string name="intro_zeus_2">Release inside the band.</string>
    <string name="intro_zeus_2_body">Let go while the meter sits in the drifting gold band. A hit pays 130.</string>
    <string name="intro_zeus_3">Find the bright centre.</string>
    <string name="intro_zeus_3_body">The centre of the band is the perfect zone and pays 200 instead.</string>

    <string name="intro_pilot_1">Drag to steer.</string>
    <string name="intro_pilot_1_body">Your finger flies the plane across the corridor. Walls close in as you go.</string>
    <string name="intro_pilot_2">Stay airborne.</string>
    <string name="intro_pilot_2_body">Every second in the air banks 15 points. Coins add more, and eight in a row pays a bonus.</string>
    <string name="intro_pilot_3">One hit ends the flight.</string>
    <string name="intro_pilot_3_body">A storm cloud or a wall finishes the run, so bank points early.</string>

    <string name="intro_joker_1">Read the banner.</string>
    <string name="intro_joker_1_body">The rule sits above the grid and changes every few seconds.</string>
    <string name="intro_joker_2">Tap only what it asks for.</string>
    <string name="intro_joker_2_body">A correct tap pays 50. A wrong one costs 35, so read before you reach.</string>
    <string name="intro_joker_3">Freeze when told.</string>
    <string name="intro_joker_3_body">When the banner says FREEZE, touch nothing at all and take 150.</string>

